<p>I LOVE HEYTEA. It used to be a China-only chain, but it is rapidly expanding worldwide, and I am so happy to see it. HEYTEA finally opened a location by USC, and I happened to be there opening weekend. In typical HEYTEA fashion, there’s a BOGO during opening weekend, in which I went two days in a row. Their Triple Matcha Supreme and Coconut Mango Boom (or Blue, if you want a blue spirulina touch at no additional charge) are ideal thirst quenchers</p>

